          "q": "Q17. ConfigMap vs Secret: what's the difference?",
          "a_bullets": [
            "Both inject config into Pods; a ==Secret== holds sensitive values.",
            "ConfigMap: URLs, flags",
            "Secret: passwords, tokens, TLS keys",
            "Both capped at 1 MiB"
